	(gr_text_box "PCB\nTrace at 50ohm:\nOuter layer: 6.16 mil / 0.1565mm / 2.5x spacing (0.2348 clear)\nInner layer: 5.61 mil / 0.1425mm / 2.5x spacing (0.2138)\n\nDiff at 100ohm:\nOuter layer: 0.1090 with 0.1524 spacing (4.29/6 mils)\nInner layer: 0.1090 with 0.1854 spacing (4.29/7.3 mils)\n\nSerpentine loops:\n25 mil, 0.635mm\n\nDIFF PAIRS\n\nPCIE: 85ohm\nSATA: 100ophm\nUSB?\nLVDS?\nHDMI?\n"
		(start 177.248724 115.138189)
		(end 230.011224 165.613189)
		(margins 0.8 0.8 0.8 0.8)
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "b52bf150-21e1-4057-b736-9e5541c87357")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
				(thickness 0.15)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(border yes)
		(stroke
			(width 0.1)
			(type solid)
		)
	)
	(gr_text_box "DDR Routing\n\nCLK: Max 2.25 inch/57mm. Diff match 0.127mm\n- SDCLK / SDCLK_B\n\nDATA: Less thank clk, 0.635mm spread\n- Dx 8\n- DQM\n- SDQS / SDQS_B\n\nAddress/Command: 21. Less thank clk, 0.635mm spread\n- A0-A14\n- CAS / RAS / WE\n- BA0-BA2\n\nCONTROL: Less thank clk, 1.270mm spread\n- DRAM_CS0\n- DRAM_SDCKE0\n- DRAM_SDODT0\n\n====\nDDR_VREF\n- maintain 0.6mm to other nets\n====\nCROSSTALK\nVih - Vil = 0.35V\nWith 2.5V/s - 5V/ns = 0.07ns - 0.14ns rise time\n====\nMAX TRACK LENGTH\nFor DDR split, one branch is roughly 14-16mm\n2.25inch/57.15mm length max + 14 = 71mm\n3 inch / 76.2mm length max + 14 = 90mm\n"
		(start 230.25 21.5)
		(end 277.45 104.7)
		(margins 0.8 0.8 0.8 0.8)
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "d72614b7-ccbf-459a-9885-8a4a7337482c")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
				(thickness 0.15)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(border yes)
		(stroke
			(width 0.1)
			(type solid)
		)
	)
	(gr_text_box "SD\n\nSD3 is 4bit uSDHC slot\nCLK CMD\nDATA0-3\nRST?\nCD/GPIO"
